<title>HUNGARY: GLOBUS 1996 AFTER-TAX PROFIT 171.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>GLOBUS 1996 AFTER-TAX PROFIT 171.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Jan-Dec 1996    Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    145.4    vs    217.9</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		171.2    vs    260.7</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	    171.2    vs    248.0</p>
<p>    Net sales revenues	5,378.7    vs  5,652.2</p>
<p>	Domestic sales	  3,942.8    vs  4,668.8</p>
<p>	Export sales	    1,435.8    vs    983.4</p>
<p>    Other revenue		 455.2    vs   306.8</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales   4,054.5    vs 4,099.9</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales 1,409.9    vs 1,381.9</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	  224.1    vs   259.3</p>
<p>    Net financial income	 13.6 loss vs 199.0 loss</p>
<p>     Financial revenue	   44.0    vs     9.1</p>
<p>     Financial expenditure     57.6    vs   208.2</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income   39.4 profit vs 241.9 profit</p>
<p>     Extraordinary revenue    210.1    vs   461.5</p>
<p>     Extraordinary expend.    170.7    vs   219.6</p>
<p>    Taxation			  -	vs    12.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Globus Konzervipari Rt is a canned food and fruit</p>
<p>juice maker company. The figures were prepared in accordance</p>
<p>with Hungarian Accounting Standards. The 1996 figures are not</p>
<p>audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
